kcast (0.4.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed the panel/taskbar icon disappearing again after the 0.4.2
    packaging fix (#26) — switched to KPackage's package-relative icon
    notation, which works for plain .plasmoid installs too, not just
    RPM/deb. Also fixed Kirigami.Icon misrendering the multi-color logo
    as a solid mask, and the wrong (solid-black) icon asset being
    referenced.

 -- Agundur <info@agundur.de>  Mon, 31 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0200

kcast (0.4.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Packaging-only fix: no functional changes over 0.4.1.

 -- Agundur <info@agundur.de>  Sun, 30 Aug 2026 13:30:00 +0200

kcast (0.4.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added manual device entry to the cast target picker (config page and
    widget popup), as a fallback for when `catt scan` doesn't find a
    reachable device.
  * Fixed the config page's Apply/OK not saving a manually typed device,
    and an already-open widget popup not picking up a device Applied
    from the config page live.
  * Fixed the panel/taskbar icon showing a generic placeholder instead
    of the actual KCast logo.

 -- Agundur <info@agundur.de>  Sun, 30 Aug 2026 13:15:00 +0200

kcast (0.3.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed drag-and-drop in the full representation: the DropArea had no
    z-index, so it sat behind the playlist/URL-field content (declared
    later = in front) and never received drags over any visible control.
  * Fixed a TypeError on drop: dropped URLs are QUrl objects, not JS
    strings — string ops crashed silently, visible only in the journal.

 -- Agundur <info@agundur.de>  Thu, 30 Jul 2026 16:30:00 +0200

kcast (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Removed the C++ plugin entirely (KCastBridge) — KCast is now pure
    QML, all catt invocation goes through Plasma5Support's executable
    engine. No compiled .so anymore, installs cleanly via a plain
    kpackagetool6 -i/-u with no CMake build step required.
  * Added playlist support (search/shuffle/repeat, folder & M3U/M3U8
    import, drag-and-drop of multiple files).
  * Added a seek bar (-10s/+10s buttons, draggable position slider).

 -- Agundur <info@agundur.de>  Thu, 30 Jul 2026 12:25:00 +0200

kcast (0.2.7-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed install(DIRECTORY package/...) shipping raw C++ source/CMakeLists
    as installed plasmoid data.
  * Fixed panel-icon scroll-to-change-volume, dead cursor styling, and a
    non-existent scanDevicesWithCatt() call in Settings' device search.
  * Fixed the bridge's mediaUrl going stale after a drag-and-drop or
    file-picker selection.
  * Now also builds and releases RPMs via OBS (previously .deb only).

 -- Agundur <info@agundur.de>  Thu, 09 Jul 2026 10:35:00 +0200

